# The table editor, the levels of a table (tests/t1/pinball3d_editor.sh), window 1440x900.
# An upper playfield: its outline, four points, Enter. It stands 5 cm above the playfield (the format's default).
4 key g meta
5 text +floor
6 key Enter
8 move 739 149
9 down
10 up
11 move 831 149
12 down
13 up
14 move 831 281
15 down
16 up
17 move 739 281
18 down
19 up
20 key Enter
# L goes from all the levels to the playfield, then to the upper one: what stands on the others is only hinted at.
23 key l
25 key l
# A bumper placed now stands on that level.
27 key g meta
28 text +bumper
29 key Enter
31 move 785 215
32 down
33 up
# Save.
36 key s meta
